     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">為甚麼下面這個問題的答案好像稍有出入??<br>請問各位正確該如何解呢...<br><br>A sample of n = 16 observations is drawn\r\nfrom a normal population<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">with m = 1, 000 and s = 200.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">一個有</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">16</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">個觀察值的樣本是從常態母體得出，其中</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">m =\r\n1,000</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">和</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">s = 200</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;\\0065b0\\007d30\\00660e\\009ad4&quot;,serif\">。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:18.0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">a.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:7pt;line-height:normal;font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;\">     \r\n</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">P(X≥1050)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\n1-pnorm(1050,1000,200)<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 0.4012937<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">b. P(X&lt;960)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;\r\npnorm(960,1000,200)<u></u><u></u></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 0.4207403<br><br><u></u><u></u></span></b></p></div>"
